OL,3,GNEWSADundee University and UCU reach
OL,4,Adeal over redundancy proposals
OL,5,
OL,6,FDundee University has reached an
OL,7,Fagreement with the University and
OL,8,FCollege Union (UCU) in a long-running
OL,9,Fdispute over compulsory redundancies at
OL,10,Fthe cash-strapped institution.
OL,12,FThe union has staged a series of
OL,13,Fstrikes, the most recent for five weeks
OL,14,Fin September, against compulsory
OL,15,Fredundancies at the university.
OL,17,FThe Dundee UCU said it would it would
OL,18,Fsuspend any industrial action related
OL,19,Fto the dispute for the rest of the year
OL,20,Fas a result of the agreement.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
