OL,3,GNEWSADundee University and UCU reach
OL,4,Adeal over redundancy proposals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe joint agreement includes the
OL,7,Fimplementation of a final enhanced
OL,8,Fvoluntary redundancy scheme (VR2) and
OL,9,Favoiding compulsory redundancies
OL,10,F"wherever possible."
